%% Kiro-API V3 — self-healing auth state machine
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unknown
    Unknown --> LoggedIn: whoami ok + token valid
    Unknown --> LoggedOut: whoami fails / no token

    LoggedOut --> LoggingIn: kiro-api login (device flow)
    LoggingIn --> LoggedIn: device approved, token cached
    LoggingIn --> LoggedOut: login failed / timed out

    LoggedIn --> ExpiringSoon: expiresAt within refresh_margin
    ExpiringSoon --> Refreshing: watchdog triggers proactive refresh
    Refreshing --> LoggedIn: refresh succeeded (new expiresAt)
    Refreshing --> LoggedOut: refresh not possible (re-login needed)

    LoggedIn --> LoggedOut: token expired / revoked

    note right of ExpiringSoon
        the fix for V2's "stuck on a
        stale token": refresh BEFORE
        any worker uses it
    end note
    note right of LoggedOut
        service stays UP (never crashes);
        requests get 401; tray = yellow;
        auto-recovers on re-login
    end note
